WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.734
Joining us now is

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:01.935
the vice chair of the Senate

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.303
Intelligence Committee,

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.504
Republican Senator Marco

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:05.638
Rubio of Florida.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.307
Senator, thanks so much for joining us.

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.375
So you have said

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:08.975
that President Biden

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.043
should have shot the balloon down.

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:10.744
Earlier,

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.245
the defense secretary, Lloyd Austin,

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:14.180
said, quote, After careful analysis, U.S.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.315
military commanders

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.384
had determined to downing the balloon

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:19.419
while Overland posed an undue

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:20.253
risk to people

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.755
across a wide area

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:22.489
due to the size

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:23.857
and altitude of the balloon

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.126
and its surveillance payload.

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:28.161
And as you heard Secretary about a judge

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:28.928
just a few minutes ago

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.730
said that the debris field

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:31.831
after the balloon was shot

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.433
down was about seven miles long.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:34.000
Should President

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.035
Biden have ordered that it be

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:35.468
shot down

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.972
anyway, regardless of that risk?

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:41.074
No, not regardless of the risk.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:41.574
First of all,

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:42.842
that they can track these things.

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:43.209
I would hope

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.345
you can track a slow moving balloon

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:46.813
that clearly is headed here.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.515
As you can see from its trajectory.

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:48.915
I think that's

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:49.616
one of the things we've learned

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.151
this week is how soon,

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.685
how late into January?

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:53.720
Did they already know that

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.055
there's this high altitude balloon

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.222
and what its trajectory was

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:56.923
and where it was headed?

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.124
And why didn't they take action

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.959
at that time? That's number one.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:00.794
I think the other thing

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:01.861
that we need to know about it

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.329
and understand is

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:04.731
why did it take so long for them

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.433
to disclose this to the American public?

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:07.801
I don't think the trajectory

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.502
of where this balloon was going

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:10.270
was a mystery.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.171
I think pretty early

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:12.038
on, they probably

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:13.339
because of the prevailing winds,

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:14.274
because of the direction

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:15.008
that it was headed.

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:15.842
I think it was pretty clear

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:16.776
that this thing was going to enter

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:18.478
the northwest in Montana.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:19.145
In Idaho,

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:19.946
move its way down

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:21.514
the Middle West and exit the

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:22.515
the Eastern Seaboard,

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.017
just off the Carolinas.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:24.451
I mean,

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:26.586
that's an unprecedented flight path.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.755
And why did it wait till Wednesday

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:30.123
to notify air Thursday

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:30.824
to talk about it

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:31.658
to the American people,

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:32.959
knowing people were going to be seeing

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:33.860
this thing?

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:35.562
As vice chair of the Senate

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:37.030
Intelligence Committee, do you know?

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:37.697
Has the U.S.

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:40.166
recovered any parts of the Chinese spy

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.000
balloon has them?

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.303
And did the monitoring of the balloon

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:44.671
during its journey

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:45.905
as far as, you know, yield

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:48.141
any worthwhile information for the U.S.

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:50.610
Well,

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.244
we won't know that

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.245
until we get into a secure

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:53.680
setting this week in Washington.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.215
And probably most of that

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:56.716
is something we won't be able to disclose

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:57.684
in any great detail.

00:01:57.684 --> 00:01:58.651
Other than to say this.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:01:59.519
And that is that,

00:01:59.519 --> 00:01:59.786
you know,

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:00.954
they're going to try to recover this.

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:02.455
Apparently, it's in shallow waters.

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.224
We'll see what they recover from it.

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:06.025
But I don't think the technology

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.427
or the existence of these things

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:08.261
is a great mystery.

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:09.329
I think what's embedded

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:10.730
here is a clear message.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.066
It's not a coincidence that this happens

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:14.000
leading up to the State

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:14.968
of the Union address,

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.803
leading up to Blinken's visit to China.

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:17.637
The Chinese knew

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:18.938
that this was going to be spotted.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:19.472
They knew that

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:20.974
we were going to have to react to it.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:21.841
They flew it over.

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.042
Military installations

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.844
and sensitive sites are crossed

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:25.879
right across the middle.

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:26.779
I mean, look at the flight

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:27.680
path of this thing.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.982
It's a diagonal shot right

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:29.616
through the middle

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:31.084
of the continental United States.

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:32.152
And the message embedded

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:33.553
in this to the world is

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:36.789
we can fly a balloon over airspace

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:38.158
of the United States of America,

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:38.892
and it won't be able

00:02:38.892 --> 00:02:40.894
to do anything about it to stop us.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:43.029
They calculated this carefully

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.631
with a message embedded in it.

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:45.565
And I think that's the part

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:46.533
we can't forget here.

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:47.400
It's not just the balloon.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.067
It's the message

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:49.435
they're trying to send the world

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:50.270
that we can do

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.437
whatever we want in America,

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:52.705
can't stop us.

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:53.373
What information

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:54.741
do you think the spy balloon

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:56.876
might have gleaned as it as it traveled?

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:58.478
I know it was over

00:02:58.478 --> 00:02:59.979
the fears that it was over some U.S.

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:01.281
military installations.

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:03.783
I'm also wondering if infrastructure

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:06.085
was probably part of the surveillance

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:06.920
task it had

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:09.722
Well, again, it would

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:10.523
be speculation

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:11.958
other than to tell you that those things

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:13.226
usually at that altitude

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:13.893
and what they're doing

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.028
is probably trying to collect

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:16.996
on signals on electronic information

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:17.730
that's transiting

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.599
that they can pick up on their various

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:20.066
other means,

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:21.267
that they can do that as well.

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:21.701
And that's why

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:22.135
I go back

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:23.570
to the whole point of the message.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:24.971
There are probably other ways

00:03:24.971 --> 00:03:26.072
that China could acquire

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:26.973
whatever they acquired

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:27.707
using this balloon.

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:28.374
I may be wrong

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:30.076
there may be some unique attributes to it

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:31.744
that I'm that I'm not aware of yet,

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:33.413
but we'll learn more about this week.

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:34.681
But I think more than anything

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:35.515
else, beyond

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:37.650
just the ability to collect information,

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.052
it is the ability

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:40.353
to send a clear message.

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:40.720
And that is

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.722
that we have the ability to do this.

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:43.389
And America

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.424
can't do anything about it

00:03:44.424 --> 00:03:45.158
if they're not going to be able

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:47.160
to stop a balloon from flying over U.S.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:47.961
airspace.

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:49.696
How is America going to come to your aid

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:50.930
if we invade Taiwan

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.032
or take land from India or take islands

00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:54.734
from the Philippines and Japan?

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:55.702
And I think

00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:56.869
the fact that they would do that

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:57.303
leading up

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:58.304
to State of the Union,

00:03:58.304 --> 00:03:59.739
leading up to what was then

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:01.140
Blinken's scheduled visit,

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.475
none of that is a coincidence.

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:03.376
So we need to understand

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:05.211
clearly there was messaging behind this.

00:04:05.211 --> 00:04:05.511
But you so

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:06.846
you think that first of all,

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:08.281
I guess there are two parts to a question

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:09.482
I have following up on that.

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:10.383
One is

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:10.883
the Pentagon

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:12.819
says that they know of the Chinese

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:14.220
doing this at least four other times.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.256
Previously, once at the beginning

00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:17.257
of the Biden administration,

00:04:17.257 --> 00:04:17.757
three times

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:18.958
during the Trump administration,

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:20.093
it seems to be you're saying,

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:21.361
oh, you're saying, no, that's not true.

00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:23.396
But in any case, is that is the no.

00:04:23.396 --> 00:04:24.230
What's the defense?

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:26.399
Okay.

00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:27.767
Well, the difference is this.

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:28.501
Are we aware?

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:29.902
Have we seen the Chinese fly

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:30.937
these balloons in the past?

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:31.237
Yes.

00:04:31.237 --> 00:04:31.938
I think there's even

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:32.839
Twitter pictures of it

00:04:32.839 --> 00:04:34.440
flying at one point

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.242
off the coast of the US down

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:37.143
south somewhere

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:38.678
that the existence of the balloons

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:39.946
is not a mystery to people.

00:04:39.946 --> 00:04:41.581
And in that field.

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:42.649
What we've never seen,

00:04:42.649 --> 00:04:43.650
what is unprecedented

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:44.417
and whoever the source

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:45.618
was at the Department of Defense,

00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:46.519
would have to acknowledge just

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:48.988
what is unprecedented is a balloon flight

00:04:49.489 --> 00:04:51.090
that entered over Idaho

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.592
and flew over Montana

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:53.159
over all

00:04:53.159 --> 00:04:54.961
these sensitive military installations,

00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:57.497
Air Force bases, ICBM fields

00:04:57.497 --> 00:04:58.865
right across the middle of the country.

00:04:58.865 --> 00:05:00.166
That has never happened before.

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:01.401
That is unprecedented,

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:02.502
that it flew briefly

00:05:02.502 --> 00:05:04.570
over some part of the U.S.A. U.S.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.371
That's one thing

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:06.873
but what we saw this week,

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:07.707
it's unprecedented.

00:05:07.707 --> 00:05:08.374
And that's why

00:05:08.374 --> 00:05:09.309
everyone's reacting the way

00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:11.277
they're reacting. We've never seen this.

00:05:11.277 --> 00:05:12.779
So this is no comparison

00:05:12.779 --> 00:05:13.279
to anything

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:14.881
that may have happened up to this point.

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:15.481
Your colleague

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:16.049
and friend,

00:05:16.049 --> 00:05:17.550
Republican Senator Tim Scott of South

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.351
Carolina, accused

00:05:18.351 --> 00:05:19.485
President Biden

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:21.854
of, quote, dereliction of duty

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:23.656
by allowing the Chinese

00:05:23.656 --> 00:05:25.892
spy balloon to fly across the U.S..

00:05:26.059 --> 00:05:27.427
That's a pretty strong accusation.

00:05:27.427 --> 00:05:28.161
Do you agree with that?

00:05:30.063 --> 00:05:30.630
Well, I think the

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.198
dereliction of duty begins with this.

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:33.900
Why not on Tuesday or Wednesday?

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.201
You know, people are going to see this

00:05:35.201 --> 00:05:35.702
at some point.

00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:37.003
You're going to have to disclose it.

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:38.504
And they probably didn't want to

00:05:38.504 --> 00:05:39.005
because they didn't

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:39.839
want to have their hand

00:05:39.839 --> 00:05:42.208
forced on canceling this Blinken visit.

00:05:42.442 --> 00:05:43.609
And so they didn't

00:05:43.609 --> 00:05:44.010
so they didn't

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.178
want to have to talk about it.

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:46.245
But why didn't the president

00:05:46.245 --> 00:05:47.246
go on television?

00:05:47.246 --> 00:05:48.981
He has the ability to convene the country

00:05:48.981 --> 00:05:49.716
and cameras

00:05:49.716 --> 00:05:50.750
and basically explain

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:51.784
what we're dealing with here

00:05:51.784 --> 00:05:53.152
and why he's made the decisions

00:05:53.152 --> 00:05:55.021
he's making and what they intend to do.

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:56.022
I don't understand.

00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:57.924
Once they get went public with it,

00:05:57.924 --> 00:05:59.292
knowing the amount of interest

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:00.360
this was going to generate.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.061
Presidents have the ability to go

00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:03.129
before camera,

00:06:03.129 --> 00:06:03.396
but go

00:06:03.396 --> 00:06:04.364
before the nation

00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:05.465
and basically explain

00:06:05.465 --> 00:06:06.666
these things early on.

00:06:06.666 --> 00:06:08.634
And his failure to do so.

00:06:08.634 --> 00:06:09.635
I don't understand that.

00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:10.169
I don't understand

00:06:10.169 --> 00:06:11.371
why he wouldn't do that.

00:06:11.371 --> 00:06:12.672
And that is the beginning,

00:06:12.672 --> 00:06:13.506
a dereliction of duty.

00:06:13.506 --> 00:06:14.407
And the second is

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:16.442
we have to act swiftly on these things.

00:06:16.442 --> 00:06:17.176
I think that's part

00:06:17.176 --> 00:06:17.877
of the one of the things

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:19.145
the Chinese are trying to message

00:06:19.145 --> 00:06:19.946
and that is

00:06:19.946 --> 00:06:21.748
the US had to see this coming

00:06:21.748 --> 00:06:23.416
and decided they couldn't or wouldn't

00:06:23.416 --> 00:06:24.784
do anything about it early on

00:06:24.784 --> 00:06:25.618
and now had to wait

00:06:25.618 --> 00:06:26.185
until this thing

00:06:26.185 --> 00:06:27.887
went across the middle of the country.

00:06:27.887 --> 00:06:29.422
And and what are we going to do

00:06:29.422 --> 00:06:30.490
the next time this happens?

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.190
Are we going to allow it

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.025
to fly through here again

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:34.293
and shoot it down

00:06:34.293 --> 00:06:35.828
once it gets to the East Coast?

00:06:35.828 --> 00:06:36.863
I mean, these are questions

00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:38.464
the White House needs to answer.

00:06:38.464 --> 00:06:40.233
And I don't think these are partizan

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:41.100
claims I'm making.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:42.969
I think there would be a broad agreement

00:06:42.969 --> 00:06:43.636
that we need to know.

00:06:43.636 --> 00:06:44.637
Moving forward

00:06:44.637 --> 00:06:45.772
what our policy is going to be

00:06:45.772 --> 00:06:46.839
with regards to this.

00:06:46.839 --> 00:06:48.141
So, as you noted, Secretary Blinken,

00:06:48.141 --> 00:06:49.442
did cancel his trip

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:50.510
to China

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.944
after it was disclosed that this balloon

00:06:51.944 --> 00:06:53.413
was was flying over the U.S..

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:55.248
What additional consequences

00:06:55.248 --> 00:06:56.149
should there be for the

00:06:56.149 --> 00:06:57.049
Chinese government now

00:06:58.951 --> 00:06:59.385
Well, I think the

00:06:59.385 --> 00:07:00.520
first consequence has to be

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.821
we have to decide

00:07:01.821 --> 00:07:02.522
what are we going to do

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:03.122
the next time

00:07:03.122 --> 00:07:04.357
one of these things had to this way?

00:07:04.357 --> 00:07:04.891
Because I don't think

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:05.725
it'll be the last time.

00:07:05.725 --> 00:07:07.293
I think you'll see it again.

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:08.461
Beyond consequences.

00:07:08.461 --> 00:07:09.362
I'm not sure there should be

00:07:09.362 --> 00:07:11.264
a direct individual consequence.

00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:12.765
I think the broader relationship

00:07:12.765 --> 00:07:14.233
between the US and China

00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:16.169
to anyone who has any doubts about it.

00:07:16.169 --> 00:07:18.504
Now, the bottom line is here, and that is

00:07:18.671 --> 00:07:19.939
we are now

00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:22.408
China has been for some time and will be

00:07:22.508 --> 00:07:23.810
the primary strategic

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.111
adversary of the United States

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:26.679
and we should be focused on it

00:07:26.679 --> 00:07:27.780
because what they're trying to do

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.548
is create a world

00:07:28.548 --> 00:07:29.282
in which they are

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:30.683
the most powerful nation

00:07:30.683 --> 00:07:32.418
and the United States is a great power

00:07:32.418 --> 00:07:33.286
and decline

00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:34.053
that that is

00:07:34.053 --> 00:07:35.688
that is what they believe to be the case

00:07:35.688 --> 00:07:37.190
That is what they are working on.

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:38.191
And we have to determine

00:07:38.191 --> 00:07:39.358
whether we're going to allow the world

00:07:39.358 --> 00:07:40.893
to head in that direction or not.

00:07:40.893 --> 00:07:42.228
And then there's all sorts of things

00:07:42.228 --> 00:07:42.995
we need to do

00:07:42.995 --> 00:07:44.630
from how we're postured militarily

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:45.865
in the Indo-Pacific

00:07:45.865 --> 00:07:46.732
all the way to

00:07:46.732 --> 00:07:47.834
what kind of companies do

00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:49.569
we allow to operate in the United States

00:07:49.569 --> 00:07:50.703
and spy on us?

00:07:50.703 --> 00:07:52.205
Because we've invited them in,

00:07:52.205 --> 00:07:53.773
because they're in our infrastructure

00:07:53.773 --> 00:07:54.841
and our telecommunications

00:07:54.841 --> 00:07:55.708
infrastructure,

00:07:55.708 --> 00:07:57.043
because they're buying land

00:07:57.043 --> 00:07:58.444
because they're buying farmland,

00:07:58.444 --> 00:07:58.978
because they're

00:07:58.978 --> 00:08:00.446
because they're wiping out key

00:08:00.446 --> 00:08:03.015
industrial capabilities of this country.

00:08:03.015 --> 00:08:04.083
There's all kinds of things

00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:04.951
that need to be discussed

00:08:04.951 --> 00:08:06.219
when it comes to China,

00:08:06.219 --> 00:08:08.287
because this is the issue of the 21st

00:08:08.287 --> 00:08:09.121
century.

00:08:09.121 --> 00:08:10.656
The Chinese government says

00:08:10.656 --> 00:08:12.658
now that the US has shot down

00:08:12.658 --> 00:08:13.860
that balloon,

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.528
they reserve the right to use

00:08:15.528 --> 00:08:17.230
whatever means they want to deal with any

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:18.297
any similar situation.

00:08:18.297 --> 00:08:20.366
There's even talk in the Global Times,

00:08:20.366 --> 00:08:22.034
which is basically a Chinese mouthpiece,

00:08:22.034 --> 00:08:23.402
that that shooting down

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:25.905
what they say is a civilian balloon

00:08:25.905 --> 00:08:28.140
that's a dangerous precedent and they

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:28.975
might shoot down

00:08:30.276 --> 00:08:30.943
U.S.

00:08:30.943 --> 00:08:33.145
civilian apparatuses.

00:08:33.212 --> 00:08:34.046
What do you make of that?

00:08:34.046 --> 00:08:34.413
Are you

00:08:34.413 --> 00:08:35.014
are you

00:08:35.014 --> 00:08:37.216
fearful at all of this escalating?

00:08:39.151 --> 00:08:41.053
Listen, if we were to fly anything over

00:08:41.053 --> 00:08:42.555
China, they're going to shoot it down.

00:08:42.555 --> 00:08:43.623
They're going to shoot it down

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:44.824
and they're going to hold up

00:08:44.824 --> 00:08:46.092
and they're going to take pictures of it

00:08:46.092 --> 00:08:48.427
and they're going to go bonkers about it.

00:08:48.661 --> 00:08:50.129
So I don't know what statement

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:50.530
they're making.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:50.897
You can't

00:08:50.897 --> 00:08:52.098
you can't fly anything over

00:08:52.098 --> 00:08:52.965
China now anyways.

00:08:52.965 --> 00:08:54.367
I mean, if we were to do that,

00:08:54.367 --> 00:08:55.801
if we were to fly a balloon over China,

00:08:55.801 --> 00:08:57.169
the Goodyear blimp flew over China,

00:08:57.169 --> 00:08:58.170
they'd shoot it down.

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.740
So it's it's a

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:01.908
it's what they do over there.

00:09:01.908 --> 00:09:02.909
It's it's silly talk.

00:09:02.909 --> 00:09:04.944
Bottom line is, I think that's that's

00:09:05.811 --> 00:09:07.213
that's what we should expect anyway.

